# A metal plane above spreads the heat sideways: lower response, far more crosstalk.
# Reference: the same mesh solved with a sparse direct solver in SciPy.
title Aluminium plane 1 um above the heater
grid dx=0.25 dy=0.25
window width=80 ymin=-10 ymax=7
layer si -10 0
layer sio2 0 7
rect si -0.25 0.25 2 2.25
rect tin -1 1 4 4.25
heater h1 xmin=-1 xmax=1 ymin=4 ymax=4.25 power=0.1
probe wg1 xmin=-0.25 xmax=0.25 ymin=2 ymax=2.25
rect al -40 40 5.5 6.5
rect si 9.75 10.25 2 2.25
probe wg2 xmin=9.75 xmax=10.25 ymin=2 ymax=2.25
expect response wg1 h1 84.2246692 1e-7
expect response wg2 h1 18.3014902 1e-7
expect pi_power wg1 h1 49.4708582 1e-7
expect peak 21.8894894 1e-7
expect balance 1e-9
expect cells 21760
